<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ACC Corp started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of ACC Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- expects ACC to earn $1.10 a share in 1997 and $1.50 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month target of $38.</p>
<p>-- ACC gained 2-1/8 to 20-1/2.</p>
</text>
